<view class="page"><responsive-topbar title="储值账户" subtitle="余额与流水由服务端记录" bind:back="back"/><view wx:if="{{status == 'loading'}}" class="state">正在加载储值账户</view><view wx:elif="{{status == 'forbidden'}}" class="state"><text>需要登录</text><text>{{errorText}}</text></view><view wx:elif="{{status == 'error'}}" class="state error"><text>储值账户加载失败</text><text>{{errorText}}</text><button bindtap="retry">重新加载</button></view><block wx:elif="{{account}}"><view class="hero"><text>可用余额</text><text>¥{{account.balance}}</text><text>冻结金额 ¥{{account.frozen}}</text></view><view class="card"><text class="title">测试充值预览</text><text class="warning">真实支付通道尚未配置；创建意向不会扣款，也不会增加余额。</text><input type="digit" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="inputAmount" placeholder="输入测试金额"/><button disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="createTopupIntent">{{submitting ? '正在生成' : '生成测试充值意向'}}</button><text wx:if="{{intent}}">意向 {{intent.id || '已生成'}} · ¥{{intent.amount}} · {{intent.status}}</text></view><view class="card"><text class="title">账户流水</text><view wx:for="{{ledger}}" wx:key="_id" class="row"><view><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.time}}</text></view><text>{{item.amountText}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{!ledger.length}}" class="empty">暂无储值流水</text></view></block></view>
